    "title": "Holograf",
    "description": "An Algorithm 3D Visualizer\nGithub Profile: https://github.com/SuspiciousPi/Holograf\n\nA web application that renders 3D visualizations of algorithms and program flow. The application is a tool for software engineers, from brand new beginners to experienced veterans, that allows users to input source code and visualize fully rendered 3D visualizations of their code.\n\nThe program parses code in an abstract syntax tree (AST) and compiles it into data that is converted into 3D renderings using the Three.js library. The front end of the application uses the ReactJS framework using Flux architecture. The back end uses Node.js and Express which is connected to a Mongo database where users can save their favorite visualizations and share with other users.",
